#: ../../deploy.md:1
msgid "部署与运维"
msgstr "Deployment and operations"

#: ../../deploy.md:3
msgid ""
"本文是 sapic v2 的生产部署与运维手册：组成部分、生产部署（venv + gunicorn + systemd + nginx）、 "
"容器与编排、数据库、升级与备份、观测。"
msgstr ""
"This is the production deployment and operations manual for sapic v2: "
"components, production deployment (venv + gunicorn + systemd + nginx), "
"containers and orchestration, database, upgrades and backups, "
"observability."

#: ../../deploy.md:6
msgid ""
"只想尽快跑起来，走[快速开始](quickstart.md)；本地开发环境见[安装与部署](install.md)； "
"配置项与站点设置的含义见[配置](config.md)；出问题看[常见问题](faq.md)。"
msgstr ""
"To get it running quickly see [Quick start](quickstart.md); the local "
"development environment is in [Installation](install.md); what options and "
"site settings mean is in [Configuration](config.md); when something breaks "
"see [Troubleshooting](faq.md)."

