#: ../../deploy.md:61
msgid ""
"`sapic_secretkey` 是**可选**的：不写就用内置默认密钥。但它是公开串，公网多用户站点建议加一行 "
"`sapic_secretkey=<openssl rand -hex 32>`，否则读过源码的人能伪造会话 Cookie。"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_secretkey` is **optional**: without it the built-in default key is "
"used. But it is a public string, so a public multi-user site should add "
"`sapic_secretkey=<openssl rand -hex 32>`, otherwise anyone who has read the"
" source can forge session cookies."

#: ../../deploy.md:64
msgid ""
"全部配置项的默认值与含义见[配置](config.md)的进程级配置表；站点级设置（站点名、上传白名单与大小、 "
"注册审核、SMTP、钩子开关等）存在数据库的 `settings` 表里，进后台 `/admin/setting` 维护。"
msgstr ""
"Defaults and meanings of every option are in the process-level table in "
"[Configuration](config.md); site-level settings (site name, upload "
"allowlist and sizes, registration review, SMTP, hook switches …) live in "
"the `settings` table and are maintained under `/admin/setting`."

