msgid "nginx 站点"
msgstr "The nginx site"

#: ../../deploy.md:163
msgid "关键点："
msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../deploy.md:165
msgid ""
"`sapic_proxyfix=1`（或环境变量）必须开：Flask 侧据此信任 `X-Forwarded-Proto/Host`，否则 "
"`request.is_secure` 为假，登录 Cookie 不会带 `Secure`，回调地址也可能拼错。"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_proxyfix=1` (or the environment variable) must be on: Flask then "
"trusts `X-Forwarded-Proto/Host`. Without it `request.is_secure` is false, "
"the session cookie loses `Secure`, and callback URLs may be built wrong."

#: ../../deploy.md:167
msgid ""
"上面的示例是 **nginx 自己终止 TLS**，所以 `X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme` 是对的。如果 nginx "
"前面还有一层 Traefik / WAF / 云负载均衡负责 TLS，`$scheme` 恒为 `http`，必须改成透传， 否则会把外层的 "
"`https` 覆盖掉（容器镜像里的 `docker/nginx.conf` 已用 `map` 做兜底）："
msgstr ""
"The example above has **nginx terminating TLS itself**, so `X-Forwarded-"
"Proto $scheme` is correct. If a Traefik / WAF / cloud load balancer in "
"front of nginx handles TLS, `$scheme` is always `http` and you must pass "
"the header through instead, or the outer `https` gets overwritten (the "
"container `docker/nginx.conf` already does this with a `map`):"

#: ../../deploy.md:180
msgid "**前后端同源**：`/api`、`/raw/` 与静态资源必须在同一个域名/端口下，Cookie 会话才生效。"
msgstr ""
"**Same origin for the front end and the API**: `/api`, `/raw/` and the "
"static assets must be served from the same domain and port for cookie "
"sessions to work."

#: ../../deploy.md:181
msgid ""
"想用 CDN 或独立图片域名时，配 `sapic_external_base_url=https://cdn.example.com`， `/raw`"
" 链接会带该前缀。"
msgstr ""
"To use a CDN or a dedicated image domain, set "
"`sapic_external_base_url=https://cdn.example.com` and `/raw` links get that"
" prefix."

#: ../../deploy.md:183
msgid ""
"**上传上限是三层取最小值**：nginx 的 `client_max_body_size`、进程级 `sapic_maxupload` （映射 "
"`MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH`）、站点设置里按媒体类型的单文件上限 （`upload_image_max_size` / "
"`upload_video_max_size`）。multipart 有额外开销，进程级上限要比 站点上限略大。"
msgstr ""
"**The upload limit is the minimum of three layers**: nginx "
"`client_max_body_size`, the process-level `sapic_maxupload` (mapped to "
"`MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH`) and the per-media-type file limit in the site "
"settings (`upload_image_max_size` / `upload_video_max_size`). Multipart "
"adds overhead, so keep the process-level limit slightly above the site "
"limit."

#: ../../deploy.md:187
msgid ""
"**防盗链**：用户可在「个性化」里为自己的公开图开启 Referer 校验，拦截发生在 `/raw/`， nginx 只要原样转发 "
"`Referer`（默认就转发），不要清空它。图片走存储直链（存储后端配了加速域名、 或图片是外链登记）时 sapic 不在链路上，需要在 "
"CDN/静态服务器侧另外配置："
msgstr ""
"**Hotlink protection**: users can enable referrer checking for their public"
" images in Personalisation; the check happens on `/raw/`, so nginx only "
"needs to forward `Referer` untouched (it does by default) — never strip it."
" When images are served from a storage direct link (a backend with an "
"acceleration domain, or an image registered as an external link) sapic is "
"not in the path, so the CDN / static server needs the same rule:"

#: ../../deploy.md:199
msgid "阿里云 OSS / 腾讯云 COS 在控制台「防盗链」里配同一份白名单，并显式选择是否允许空 Referer。"
msgstr ""
"Configure the same allowlist under hotlink protection in the Aliyun OSS / "
"Tencent COS console, and choose explicitly whether an empty Referer is "
"allowed."

#: ../../deploy.md:201
msgid "容器与编排"
msgstr "Containers and orchestration"

#: ../../deploy.md:203
msgid ""
"镜像内已经包含 gunicorn + nginx（nginx 托管 `web/dist`，只把 `/api`、`/raw` 两条前缀反代给后端； "
"油猴脚本在 `/api/v2/userscript.user.js` 下，因此不需要单独开 location），默认监听 80 端口， "
"不需要再单独部署前端。容器内监听端口默认 `80`，可用 `SAPIC_HTTP_PORT` 改：`docker/nginx.conf` "
"是带端口占位符的模板，由 entrypoint 渲染到 `/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf`，健康检查也会跟着走 "
"同一个端口。`docker-compose.yml` 只把宿主的 `SAPIC_PORT`（默认 `80`）映射到容器 `80`。"
msgstr ""
"The image already contains gunicorn + nginx (nginx serves `web/dist` and "
"proxies only the `/api` and `/raw` prefixes to the backend; the userscript "
"lives under `/api/v2/userscript.user.js`, so no extra location is needed) "
"and listens on port 80, so there is no separate front-end deployment. The "
"container port defaults to `80` and can be changed with `SAPIC_HTTP_PORT`: "
"`docker/nginx.conf` is a template with a port placeholder that the "
"entrypoint renders to `/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf`, and the health "
"check follows the same port. `docker-compose.yml` only maps the host "
"`SAPIC_PORT` (default `80`) to container `80`."

#: ../../deploy.md:218
msgid "公网多用户建议再加一行 `-e sapic_secretkey=\"$(openssl rand -hex 32)\"`。"
msgstr ""
"On a public multi-user site add a line `-e sapic_secretkey=\"$(openssl rand"
" -hex 32)\"`."

#: ../../deploy.md:220
msgid "`docker compose up -d` 就是上面那个单容器 + SQLite 的形态："
msgstr "`docker compose up -d` is exactly that single container + SQLite shape:"

#: ../../deploy.md:227
msgid "要 PostgreSQL（多进程/多副本）时在 compose 的 `environment` 里加一行，compose 里不带数据库服务："
msgstr ""
"For PostgreSQL (multiple processes / replicas) add one line to the compose "
"`environment`; compose ships no database service:"

#: ../../deploy.md:233
msgid ""
"`docker-compose.yml` 用 SQLite（库文件在 `sapic-data` 卷里）并把 worker 限成 1，配置全部走环境变量"
" （只列必需项，其余用默认值）；`kube-sapic.yaml` 只有 Deployment + Service 两个对象：单副本， SQLite "
"落在节点本地目录（`hostPath: /data/sapic`），配置全部写在 Pod 的 `env` 里，不需要 "
"Secret/ConfigMap/PVC/Ingress。命名空间由 `kubectl -n` 指定（对象里不写死），使用前替换镜像 tag、 "
"hostPath 路径与 env 里的密钥/域名；没有 Ingress，Service 是 NodePort，外层 HTTPS 反代指向 "
"`<节点IP>:<nodePort>`。多节点集群必须把 Pod 固定到同一节点，否则换节点就是空库。 "
"两份清单都只列必需配置，其它项按需要补环境变量，清单见[配置](config.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`docker-compose.yml` uses SQLite (the database file lives on the `sapic-"
"data` volume) and caps workers at 1, with all config passed as environment "
"variables (only the required ones are listed, the rest fall back to "
"defaults). `kube-sapic.yaml` has just two objects, Deployment + Service: a "
"single replica, SQLite on a node-local directory (`hostPath: /data/sapic`) "
"and all config in the Pod `env`, with no Secret/ConfigMap/PVC/Ingress. The "
"namespace is set with `kubectl -n` (nothing is hard-coded), and you must "
"replace the image tag, the hostPath and the secret/domain in `env` before "
"use. There is no Ingress; the Service is a NodePort and the outer HTTPS "
"reverse proxy points at `<node-ip>:<nodePort>`. On a multi-node cluster the"
" Pod must be pinned to one node, otherwise moving nodes means an empty "
"database. Both manifests list only the required settings; add environment "
"variables for anything else — see [Configuration](config.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:241
msgid "要点："
msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../deploy.md:243
msgid ""
"**唯一必须挂载的路径**是 `/app/server/data`：SQLite 数据库、上传文件（`upload/`）与后台安装的 "
"第三方钩子包（`hooks/`）都在这里；不挂卷等于每次重建容器丢数据。"
msgstr ""
"**The only path you must mount** is `/app/server/data`: the SQLite "
"database, uploaded files (`upload/`) and hook packages installed from the "
"admin (`hooks/`) all live there; without a volume every container rebuild "
"loses data."

#: ../../deploy.md:245
msgid "容器内 `sapic_proxyfix=true` 必须开启（compose 与 k8s 已配），否则日志与限流拿到的是 127.0.0.1。"
msgstr ""
"Inside the container `sapic_proxyfix=true` must be on (compose and k8s "
"already set it), otherwise logs and rate limiting see 127.0.0.1."

#: ../../deploy.md:246
msgid "健康检查统一用 `GET /api/v2/health`：数据库不通返回 503。"
msgstr ""
"Use `GET /api/v2/health` for health checks: it returns 503 when the "
"database is unreachable."

#: ../../deploy.md:247
msgid ""
"上传上限有三层，改大小时一起改：nginx `client_max_body_size`（容器内 32m）、 "
"`sapic_maxupload`（25）、后台 `upload_image_max_size` / `upload_video_max_size`。"
msgstr ""
"There are three upload limits; change them together: nginx "
"`client_max_body_size` (32m in the image), `sapic_maxupload` (25) and the "
"admin `upload_image_max_size` / `upload_video_max_size`."

#: ../../deploy.md:249
msgid "本地磁盘存储只能单副本（`Recreate` 策略）；要多副本必须换成对象存储类钩子并给 `/app/server/data` 配 RWX 卷。"
msgstr ""
"Local disk storage only supports a single replica (`Recreate` strategy); "
"multiple replicas require an object-storage hook and an RWX volume for "
"`/app/server/data`."

#: ../../deploy.md:251
msgid ""
"外层 HTTPS 交给宿主机反代或集群外的网关（`kube-sapic.yaml` 只开 NodePort，没有 Ingress）， 并把 "
"`sapic_external_base_url` 设成对外地址，否则图片直链与审核邮件里的登录链接会是内网地址。 反代/Ingress "
"侧的请求体上限要 ≥ 32m，改成 Ingress 时记得加 `nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/proxy-body-"
"size`。"
msgstr ""
"Outer HTTPS belongs to the host reverse proxy or a gateway outside the "
"cluster (`kube-sapic.yaml` only opens a NodePort, there is no Ingress), and"
" `sapic_external_base_url` must be the public address, otherwise image "
"direct links and login links in review emails point at internal addresses. "
"The request-body limit on the proxy/Ingress side must be ≥ 32m; when "
"switching to an Ingress, remember `nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/proxy-body-"
"size`."

#: ../../deploy.md:255
msgid ""
"前面再套一层 Traefik / WAF 时不用改配置：容器内 nginx 用 `map` **透传**上游的 `X-Forwarded-"
"Proto`，不会再把 `https` 覆盖成 `http`（OIDC 回调地址与会话 Cookie 的 `Secure` "
"标志都依赖这个值）。前提是外层只**追加/转发**该头而不改写它；若 WAF 必须改写，用 `sapic_external_base_url` "
"兜住链接生成，并单独核对 OIDC 回调。"
msgstr ""
"No config change is needed for another Traefik / WAF in front: the "
"container nginx **passes through** the upstream `X-Forwarded-Proto` with a "
"`map` and no longer overwrites `https` with `http` (the OIDC callback URL "
"and the cookie `Secure` flag both depend on that value). The premise is "
"that the outer layer only **appends/forwards** the header; if a WAF has to "
"rewrite it, use `sapic_external_base_url` for link generation and verify "
"the OIDC callback separately."

#: ../../deploy.md:259
msgid ""
"WAF 常见坑：`/api/v2/health` 要放行（否则探针被拦会反复重启）、`/raw/*` 关掉响应体检测 "
"（二进制图片会拖慢甚至误杀）、`/api/v2/hooks/*` 放宽超时（后台装钩子会跑 pip 几十秒）、 请求体上限不小于 32m（取值链是 "
"WAF ≥ nginx 32m > `sapic_maxupload` 25M > 站点单文件上限）。"
msgstr ""
"Common WAF pitfalls: allow `/api/v2/health` (a blocked probe means restart "
"loops), disable response-body inspection on `/raw/*` (binary images slow it"
" down and get killed), raise timeouts for `/api/v2/hooks/*` (installing a "
"hook runs pip for tens of seconds) and keep the body limit at least 32m "
"(the chain is WAF ≥ nginx 32m > `sapic_maxupload` 25M > the site per-file "
"limit)."

#: ../../deploy.md:262
msgid "升级：拉新镜像重启即可，启动时自动执行数据库迁移（迁移幂等，多 worker 并发有重试保护）。"
msgstr ""
"Upgrading: pull the new image and restart; database migrations run "
"automatically at startup (they are idempotent and concurrent workers retry "
"safely)."

#: ../../deploy.md:275
msgid "迁移在应用启动时**自动执行**（多 worker 并发启动有锁冲突重试 + 迁移幂等，安全）； `flask sa upgrade` 只作运维兜底。"
msgstr ""
"Migrations run **automatically** at application startup (concurrent workers"
" retry on lock conflicts and every migration is idempotent, so it is safe);"
" `flask sa upgrade` is only the operational fallback."

#: ../../deploy.md:277
msgid "MySQL 的 DDL 不支持事务，所以每个迁移都写成可重复执行；升级失败先看日志再手工重跑即可。"
msgstr ""
"MySQL DDL is not transactional, so every migration is written to be re-"
"runnable; if an upgrade fails, read the log and run it again by hand."

#: ../../deploy.md:278
msgid "SQLite 适合单机小流量；多 worker 写并发下容易 `database is locked`，生产建议 PostgreSQL/MySQL。"
msgstr ""
"SQLite suits a single machine with light traffic; under concurrent writes "
"from several workers it easily hits `database is locked`, so use "
"PostgreSQL/MySQL in production."

#: ../../deploy.md:280
msgid "首次使用"
msgstr "First steps"

#: ../../deploy.md:282
msgid "用管理员账号登录后台，`/admin/setting` 填站点名/背景/公告，按需打开或关闭注册、匿名上传、图片广场。"
msgstr ""
"Sign in to the admin with the administrator account, fill in site name / "
"background / announcement under `/admin/setting`, and enable or disable "
"registration, anonymous uploads and the image plaza as needed."

#: ../../deploy.md:283
msgid ""
"上传白名单 `upload_allowed_ext`、图片大小 `upload_image_max_size`（默认 10M）、 视频大小 "
"`upload_video_max_size`（默认 20M）、视频开关 `allow_video` 在后台「站点设置」， 与进程级 "
"`sapic_maxupload`（默认 25M，整个请求）是**两层限制**，两边都要放开才能传大文件。"
msgstr ""
"The upload allowlist `upload_allowed_ext`, the image size "
"`upload_image_max_size` (10M by default), the video size "
"`upload_video_max_size` (20M by default) and the video switch `allow_video`"
" are in the admin site settings and form **two layers** together with the "
"process-level `sapic_maxupload` (25M for the whole request) — both must be "
"raised to upload big files."

#: ../../deploy.md:286
msgid ""
"图片有效期：`image_expire_default_days`（未指定时的默认寿命）与 `image_expire_max_days` "
"（单图上限）在后台「站点设置 → 上传」配置，单位天，`0` 表示永久 / 不限制；设了上限后不再允许 "
"永久图片。到期图片会在请求期被节流清理（每进程最多每 5 分钟一批），想更准时可加 cron： `flask sa purge-"
"expired`（应用目录下、用部署用的 Python 执行）。"
msgstr ""
"Image expiry: `image_expire_default_days` (lifetime when none is given) and"
" `image_expire_max_days` (per-image ceiling) are configured under admin "
"site settings → Upload, in days, with `0` meaning permanent / unlimited; "
"once a ceiling is set, permanent images are no longer allowed. Expired "
"images are cleaned up on request, throttled (at most one batch per process "
"every 5 minutes); for tighter timing add a cron job: `flask sa purge-"
"expired` (run in the application directory with the deployment Python)."

#: ../../deploy.md:290
msgid ""
"邮件（注册验证、找回密码）在后台配置 SMTP；不配也能用，但相关功能不可用。 端口决定传输方式：465/994 走隐式 SSL（不勾 "
"STARTTLS），587 勾 STARTTLS，25 一般都不用。 阿里/腾讯企业邮箱用 465 + 授权码（不是登录密码）。"
msgstr ""
"Email (registration verification, password reset) is configured in the "
"admin SMTP settings; it is optional, but the related features stay "
"unavailable without it. The port decides the transport: 465/994 use "
"implicit SSL (do not tick STARTTLS), 587 uses STARTTLS, 25 is usually not "
"needed. Aliyun / Tencent enterprise mail uses 465 with an authorisation "
"code (not the login password)."

#: ../../deploy.md:293
msgid ""
"统一登录（OIDC）：`/admin/hooks` 启用 `passport`，填 `issuer` / `client_id` / "
"`client_secret`； 在 Passport 侧登记回调地址 "
"`https://img.example.com/api/v2/auth/oidc/passport/callback`。 站内首次登录会用 "
"provider 的稳定标识（uid）建号，昵称只作显示名。 关闭 `password_login` 后只能走统一登录，建议先给管理员账号绑定 "
"OIDC 再关。"
msgstr ""
"Single sign-on (OIDC): enable `passport` under `/admin/hooks` and fill in "
"`issuer` / `client_id` / `client_secret`; register the callback "
"`https://img.example.com/api/v2/auth/oidc/passport/callback` on the "
"Passport side. The first in-site login creates an account from the provider"
" stable identifier (uid), with the nickname used only as display name. Once"
" `password_login` is off only single sign-on works, so bind the "
"administrator account to OIDC first."

#: ../../deploy.md:297
msgid ""
"存储后端：`up2local` 默认启用并自动创建 `local` 后端（写到 `STORAGE_DIR`）。要用云存储： ① 对应 SDK 已随 "
"`base.txt` 安装，无需额外操作（第三方钩子才要自己装依赖）； ② `/admin/hooks` "
"只负责启用该驱动（存储驱动的凭据不再在这里填）； ③ 进 `/admin/backends` 编辑该后端，填写必填项（带 *，如 bucket / "
"操作员 / 密码 / 加速域名）， 可用「检查」探测存储桶；④ 把它「上移」到第一位（或把优先级调到最小），之后新上传才会写到它。 "
"已有图片按副本所在后端读取，所以仍有副本的后端不允许禁用/删除。"
msgstr ""
"Storage backends: `up2local` is enabled by default and creates a `local` "
"backend automatically (writing to `STORAGE_DIR`). To use cloud storage: (1)"
" the SDK ships with `base.txt`, nothing to install (only third-party hooks "
"manage their own dependencies); (2) `/admin/hooks` only enables the driver "
"(storage credentials are no longer entered there); (3) open "
"`/admin/backends`, edit that backend and fill in the required fields "
"(marked *, e.g. bucket / operator / password / acceleration domain), using "
"Check to probe the bucket; (4) move it to the top (or give it the lowest "
"priority number) so new uploads go there. Existing images are read from the"
" backend holding their replica, so a backend that still has replicas cannot"
" be disabled or deleted."

#: ../../deploy.md:304
msgid "各配置项的完整清单见[配置](config.md)。"
msgstr "The full list of options is in [Configuration](config.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:306
msgid "升级、备份与回滚"
msgstr "Upgrades, backups and rollback"

#: ../../deploy.md:308
msgid "升级："
msgstr "Upgrading:"

#: ../../deploy.md:317
msgid "备份："
msgstr "Backups:"

#: ../../deploy.md:319
msgid "数据库：`pg_dump` / `mysqldump` / 直接拷 `sapic.db`（先停服务或 `sqlite3 .backup`）。"
msgstr ""
"Database: `pg_dump` / `mysqldump` / copy `sapic.db` (stop the service "
"first, or use `sqlite3 .backup`)."

#: ../../deploy.md:320
msgid "本地图片：`STORAGE_DIR` 整个目录。"
msgstr "Local images: the whole `STORAGE_DIR` directory."

#: ../../deploy.md:321
msgid "`server/.cfg`（密钥与 DSN）。"
msgstr "`server/.cfg` (secret and DSN)."

#: ../../deploy.md:323
msgid "回滚：迁移幂等但不支持自动回退，回滚代码前先备份数据库；结构不兼容的版本需手工降级数据。"
msgstr ""
"Rollback: migrations are idempotent but have no automatic downgrade, so "
"back up the database before rolling back the code; versions with "
"incompatible schemas need a manual data downgrade."

#: ../../deploy.md:325
msgid "从 v1 升级"
msgstr "Upgrading from v1"

#: ../../deploy.md:327
msgid ""
"数据迁移（Redis → 关系库、文件走存储驱动重传、保留原 `sha`）是独立的一次性操作，完整参数、 云存储采纳规则与客户端改配置都在[从 v1 "
"迁移数据](migrate-v1.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Data migration (Redis → relational database, files re-uploaded through the "
"storage driver, original `sha` preserved) is a one-off operation: full "
"options, cloud-storage adoption rules and client changes are in [Migrating "
"data from v1](migrate-v1.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:330
msgid "这里只强调顺序：**先迁数据、再切流量**，迁移期间停掉 v1 的写入。"
msgstr ""
"Only the order matters here: **migrate the data first, then move traffic**,"
" and stop v1 writes during the migration."

#: ../../deploy.md:332
msgid "观测"
msgstr "Observability"

#: ../../deploy.md:334
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"健康检查：`GET /api/v2/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok|degraded\", \"version\", "
"\"database\"}`， 数据库不通返回 503。"
msgstr ""
"Health: `GET /api/v2/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok|degraded\", \"version\", "
"\"database\"}`; it returns 503 when the database is unreachable."

#: ../../deploy.md:336
msgid ""
"日志：默认输出到 stdout（systemd 下 `journalctl -u sapic -f`）；日志级别用 `sapic_loglevel` "
"调。"
msgstr ""
"Logs: stdout by default (`journalctl -u sapic -f` under systemd); adjust "
"the level with `sapic_loglevel`."

#: ../../deploy.md:337
msgid "每个请求都会带 `X-Request-Id`（也可由上游传入），排查时用它串日志。"
msgstr ""
"Every request carries `X-Request-Id` (it can also be passed in from "
"upstream); use it to follow a request through the logs."

#: ../../deploy.md:339
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../deploy.md:341
msgid "启动失败、登录掉线、上传 413、`/raw` 404、钩子装不上等症状统一归到[常见问题](faq.md)， 本页只讲「怎么装起来」。"
msgstr ""
"Startup failures, lost sessions, upload 413s, `/raw` 404s and hooks that "
"will not install are all collected in [Troubleshooting](faq.md); this page "
"is only about getting it installed."

